## 🔀 Resolving a conflict

This change conflicts with what landed on `main`. The merge engine is combining them on your CI runner (structural merge, regenerated files, declared rules); the result is verified before it lands.

<details>
<summary><b>Footprint</b> · writes 2 targets · affects 3 · 1 test group</summary>

**Writes** `shop::cart` `shop::pricing`

**Affects** `shop::cart` `shop::checkout` `shop::pricing`

**Tests** `shop`

Two changes conflict only when one writes what the other writes or affects.
</details>

